      "body": "A note in the context of https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36673.\n\nThe current Windows signing certificate expires on 2027-05-31, roughly two months after the target release date, so no action is needed for this release.\n\nAdding such a note to the release schedule issue at the beginning of each cycle could be an alternative to the CI-based monitoring suggested in https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36673.",
